# Parameter definitions for thorn TestReal2
#
# TestReal2 is steered entirely by TestReal4's parameters (shared below), so
# a parfile that activates both thorns enables the same tests at all three
# precisions with a single set of run_*_test switches, exactly as the single
# combined thorn did before the REAL8/REAL4 vs. REAL2 split. The only
# parameter owned here is the REAL2 tolerance -- which is also this thorn's
# CCTK_REAL2 param.ccl coverage.

PRIVATE:

# --- Sized-REAL parameter coverage -------------------------------------
#
# TestReal2_Check (src/testreal2.cxx) uses this -- instead of a hardcoded
# constexpr tolerance -- as the pass/fail threshold for the state2 periodic
# self-test, exercising a CCTK_REAL2 param.ccl parameter end-to-end (parsed,
# range-checked, stored, and bound via DECLARE_CCTK_PARAMETERS at its
# declared width). TestReal4 does the same for CCTK_REAL8 and CCTK_REAL4
# with its own check_tolerance8/check_tolerance4.
#
# The default and par/testreal2.par's override are both exact powers of two
# (hence exactly representable in binary16, with no rounding introduced by
# storing them as a CCTK_REAL2), so TestReal2_Check can also bit-exactly
# verify the *specific* overridden value it received back from the parameter
# database, proving the parfile-parsing path for a CCTK_REAL2 parameter
# round-trips correctly.
CCTK_REAL2 check_tolerance2 "Pass/fail tolerance for state2::u2 in the periodic self-test (TestReal2_Check); default and par/testreal2.par's override are both exact powers of two"
{
  (0:1] :: "any positive tolerance, at most 1"
} 0.00390625

SHARES: TestReal4

# Which of the suite's tests to run, and the evolution test's parameters:
# owned by TestReal4 (RESTRICTED there), used here so that both precisions'
# layers are gated by the same switches and evolve the same ODE. A parfile
# therefore only ever sets TestReal4::run_*_test / TestReal4::evol_*, never
# a TestReal2 copy of them.
USES BOOLEAN run_periodic_test
USES BOOLEAN run_2lev_test
USES BOOLEAN run_bc_test
USES BOOLEAN run_evol_test
USES CCTK_REAL evol_decay_rate
USES CCTK_REAL evol_u0
